      "created_at": "2025-04-11T05:16:11.648Z",
      "cooked": "<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://europe1.discourse-cdn.com/flex013/uploads/iitm/original/3X/d/7/d70d73f625c289f10b5c77e61f5c415f89e5ddc7.png\" data-download-href=\"/uploads/short-url/uGrtHjVLY0WZ7Mks4LJqJMwnmon.png?dl=1\" title=\"image\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\"><img src=\"https://europe1.discourse-cdn.com/flex013/uploads/iitm/optimized/3X/d/7/d70d73f625c289f10b5c77e61f5c415f89e5ddc7_2_538x500.png\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"uGrtHjVLY0WZ7Mks4LJqJMwnmon\" width=\"538\" height=\"500\" srcset=\"https://europe1.discourse-cdn.com/flex013/uploads/iitm/optimized/3X/d/7/d70d73f625c289f10b5c77e61f5c415f89e5ddc7_2_538x500.png, https://europe1.discourse-cdn.com/flex013/uploads/iitm/original/3X/d/7/d70d73f625c289f10b5c77e61f5c415f89e5ddc7.png 1.5x, https://europe1.discourse-cdn.com/flex013/uploads/iitm/original/3X/d/7/d70d73f625c289f10b5c77e61f5c415f89e5ddc7.png 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"F7F7F7\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">image</span><span class=\"informations\">704×654 31.6 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div><br>\nIf the line is repeated thrice, it wouldn’t matter as it has already been printed and condition of arr[$0] == 2 will fail, so why isnt the answer more than thrice?<br>\nas the {} is neither in begin nor in end so it is not fixed</p>",
